  "name": {
    "ja": "BB戦士 MSN-04FF サザビー",
    "en": "BB Senshi MSN-04FF Sazabi"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 2200,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2023年05月03日 (水)",
    "year": 2023,
    "month": 5,
    "day": 3
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「RX-93ff νガンダム」をはじめとしたガンダムの様々な情報やグッズを取り扱うショップエリア「GUNDAM SIDE-F」の1周年を記念した限定商品。",
      "en": "A limited edition product commemorating the first lap of the shop area \"GUNDAM SIDE-F \", which handles various Gundam information and goods including \" RX-93ff νGundam\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "実物大νガンダム立像の特別映像演出に登場する「MSN-04FF サザビー」がデフォルメされてBB戦士シリーズで登場！",
      "en": "\"MSN-04FF Sazabi\" that appears in the special video production of the life-sized νGundam statue has been deformed and appears in the BB Senshi series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• より劇中のイメージに近い成形色に加え、特徴的なダブル・ホーン・ファンネルを新規造形で再現。",
      "en": "• In addition to the molding color closer to the image in the play, the characteristic double horn funnel is reproduced with new modeling."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ダブル・ホーン・ファンネルは腕部への装着や連結に加えてアクションベース5（別売）にディスプレイが可能。",
      "en": "• In addition to attaching and connecting the double horn funnel to the arm, it can also be displayed on Action Base 5 (sold separately)."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• モノアイは左右に可動。",
      "en": "• Monoeye can move left and right."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 豊富な武装が付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a variety of weapons."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各部関節が可動、様々なアクションが可能。",
      "en": "• Each joint is movable, allowing various actions."
    },
    {
      "ja": "※一般流通での販売はございません。",
      "en": "*Not available for general distribution."
    },
    {
      "ja": "※この商品は後日バンダイナムコグループ公式通販サイト、THE GUNDAM BASE各店、海外での販売も予定しております。",
      "en": "*This product is scheduled to be sold on the Bandai Namco Group's official mail order site, THE GUNDAM BASE stores, and overseas."
    }
  ],
